# The README's images (docs/assets/screenshots), from a copy of casa:
# workflow / timeline / card-source, and the thrush with $demo (guide).
# The sidebar is hidden, so the Canvas is wide and its text readable.
size 1440 900
sidebar hide
chat show
wait 3
run
waitrun
fit
wait 2
capture workflow
panel timeline
wait 2
capture timeline
panel timeline
open card spectrum source
wait 3
winsize 1200 760 spectrum
wait 2
capture card-source spectrum
close spectrum
wait 1
chatsend $demo Show me on the screen what the spectrum Card shows
waitchat 5
wait 3
capture guide
